# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Week 4 metagenomics — large data that exceeds GitHub's 100 MB file limit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# SILVA reference training set (~132 MB; re-downloadable from the SILVA project)
Cambridge/Week4_Metagenomics/project/silva_nr99_*.fa.gz

# Raw MicrobiomeHD cohort result folders — keep ONLY the cohort the CDI/FMT
# analysis actually uses (cdi_youngster_results); ignore the other 32 cohorts.
# (All of cdi_youngster_results' files are individually under GitHub's 100 MB
# limit, so the whole folder can be committed.)
Cambridge/Week4_Metagenomics/project/*_results/
!Cambridge/Week4_Metagenomics/project/cdi_youngster_results/
!Cambridge/Week4_Metagenomics/project/cdi_youngster_results/**
